# Your raw camera exports stay out of git — they're ~10MB each and git keeps
# every version of every file forever, so committing them would bloat the repo
# permanently. Keep the originals in Lightroom / your backup drive.
# What ships to the site is the resized copies below, which ARE committed.
src/assets/photos/*/
